  "description": "Northbeam Home & Garden Supply (fictional) sold 401,613 orders in the last 12 months at an average order value of $36.82 and a contribution margin of $9.06 per order before fulfilment. Supplier and inbound freight costs rise about 4.5% a year, and our list prices are 3.0% below the competitor basket. Management proposes raising all list prices by 8% from January 2027. Six past price changes (+4% to +6%) show implied volume elasticities between -1.45 and -0.57 (price-weighted mean -1.17). After the last across-the-board change (2025-10, +4%) monthly churn went from 3.38% to 3.86%. At the mean elasticity, +8% would cut order volume by about 8.6%, but the estimate is uncertain and competitors may or may not follow.",
